[
  {
    "id": "cap0",
    "start": 0,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "text": "Easy to deploy usually just means"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap1",
    "start": 2.16,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "someone else is quietly doing the"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap2",
    "start": 3.84,
    "duration": 1.76,
    "text": "DevOps work for you."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap3",
    "start": 5.6,
    "duration": 1.76,
    "text": "The question is whether that someone"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap4",
    "start": 7.36,
    "duration": 0.4,
    "text": "is you."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap5",
    "start": 8.115,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "There are two fundamentally different ways"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap6",
    "start": 10.355,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "to run a headless CMS,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap7",
    "start": 12.355,
    "duration": 1.84,
    "text": "and most people don't realize which"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap8",
    "start": 14.195,
    "duration": 1.52,
    "text": "one they signed up for until"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap9",
    "start": 15.715,
    "duration": 0.72,
    "text": "something breaks."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap10",
    "start": 16.763,
    "duration": 1.44,
    "text": "The self-hosted way,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap11",
    "start": 18.203,
    "duration": 1.2,
    "text": "you provision a server,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap12",
    "start": 19.563,
    "duration": 1.84,
    "text": "write your own deploy script,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap13",
    "start": 21.403,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "renew your own TLS certificates,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap14",
    "start": 23.643,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "set up your own database backups,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap15",
    "start": 25.643,
    "duration": 1.52,
    "text": "and get paged yourself when disk"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap16",
    "start": 27.403,
    "duration": 1.2,
    "text": "space fills up."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap17",
    "start": 28.603,
    "duration": 1.2,
    "text": "None of that shows up as"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap18",
    "start": 29.803,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "a line item anywhere."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap19",
    "start": 31.483,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "It's just time every week."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap20",
    "start": 33.496,
    "duration": 1.52,
    "text": "The push to deploy way."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap21",
    "start": 35.016,
    "duration": 1.6,
    "text": "You connect a Git repo,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap22",
    "start": 36.616,
    "duration": 1.52,
    "text": "and every push to your tracked"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap23",
    "start": 38.136,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "branch builds and ships itself automatically,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap24",
    "start": 40.936,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "with zero downtime switching to the"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap25",
    "start": 42.936,
    "duration": 0.56,
    "text": "new version."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap26",
    "start": 43.808,
    "duration": 1.28,
    "text": "The tell is simple."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap27",
    "start": 45.088,
    "duration": 1.68,
    "text": "Time how long your actual first"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap28",
    "start": 46.768,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "text": "deploy takes, start to a live"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap29",
    "start": 48.928,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "URL. If it's an afternoon of"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap30",
    "start": 51.168,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "server configuration, that's the self-hosted path."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap31",
    "start": 54.528,
    "duration": 1.28,
    "text": "If it's four steps and a"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap32",
    "start": 55.808,
    "duration": 1.44,
    "text": "few minutes, that's the other one."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap33",
    "start": 57.597,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "text": "This is the category Launchpad is"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap34",
    "start": 59.517,
    "duration": 1.28,
    "text": "built in to connect your Git"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap35",
    "start": 60.797,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "text": "repo, bring your own database,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap36",
    "start": 62.957,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "get a live preview URL on"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap37",
    "start": 64.957,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "every branch, and roll back instantly"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap38",
    "start": 67.357,
    "duration": 1.44,
    "text": "if something breaks."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap39",
    "start": 68.797,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "text": "The free personal plan alone covers"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap40",
    "start": 70.957,
    "duration": 1.44,
    "text": "most small projects,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap41",
    "start": 72.397,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "100 build minutes and 10 gigabytes,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap42",
    "start": 74.797,
    "duration": 1.12,
    "text": "no card required."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap43",
    "start": 76.229,
    "duration": 1.76,
    "text": "Before you call a host easy,"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap44",
    "start": 77.989,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "text": "ask what happens the week something"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap45",
    "start": 79.909,
    "duration": 0.8,
    "text": "actually breaks."
  },
  {
    "id": "cap46",
    "start": 81.037,
    "duration": 1.28,
    "text": "Follow for more of this kind"
  },
  {
    "id": "cap47",
    "start": 82.317,
    "duration": 0.72,
    "text": "of content."
  }
]